WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.690
Someone once said:

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:57.200
There is a well of miracles from which 
gushes forth a natural curry roux,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:00.670
turned golden from a 
combination of wild herbs...

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.870
The Currywell!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:23.990
There are hotcake berries, covered 
in a caramel-colored syrup,

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:31.300
their sponge cake smelling 
of sweet, rich, buttermilk...

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:37.600
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.010
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:51.250
Toriko has left to capture 
the legendary Puffer Whale,

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:54.320
with the unique flavor of the ocean depths...

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.920
He reunited with another 
charismatic Gourmet Hunter

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.590
of the Four Heavenly Kings, Coco.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.960
Together, they ventured 
toward the cavern lagoon

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.300
from which only 0.1% of people 
have ever returned alive.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.800
Suddenly, Komatsu went missing!

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:16.110
Then, a legendary Demon 
Beast suddenly attacked!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.890
The Deadly Cave Battle! Fire, 
Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.060
T-Toriko!

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:43.630
That's the legendary Demon 
Beast, a Devil Python!

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:53.650
Devil Python (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 21

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.780
What an incredible screech!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.220
This is bad! Its screams are reverberating!

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:10.330
What in the world is that?

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.360
What's going on?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.500
What is it?

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:43.330
Hmm, clearly something has happened here.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:46.260
Well, duh, something's happened!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:47.370
Sheesh!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:50.540
And a big heaping helping 
of something, at that!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.240
Huh? What's that?

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:04.020
I'm not going to get any yummy news 
sitting here twiddling my thumbs!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.320
Thanks to this headlamp 
that Tina let me borrow,

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:09.650
there's no need to worry about the dark.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:15.430
I prepared a miniature night-vision 
camera inside Komatsu's helmet!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.630
Proper preparation is important for 
both news gathering and cooking, see.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:20.900
Yup!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:24.340
You put a hidden camera in 
the helmet, just in case!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.470
That's just the way I operate, too.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.110
You got a good head on you, know that?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:33.510
How about you become one of I, 
the Great Zonge's, disciples, eh?

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:35.980
You don't have to show off here...

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.050
What's this?

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:40.020
Komatsu-kun?

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.990
Don't do anything stupid...

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.090
It'll all be over soon for you...

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.310
What incredible power!

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.910
I can't move!

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:08.180
Toriko!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.230
What?

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:37.140
Impossible!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.580
Is it planning on dissolving 
its own arm along with him?

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.180
Toriko!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:56.190
You think I'll let myself be eaten?

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:11.710
Knife!

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:25.990
It can regenerate its limbs like a newt!

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.190
And incredibly quickly, as well!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:47.750
I know full well how tasty your meat is!

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.320
Is that the dinner bell I hear?

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:59.090
In this pitch darkness, Toriko 
has to be at a disadvantage,

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.630
not being able to rely 
on his sense of sight...

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:05.260
Although to your eyes, Coco, this 
pitch darkness looks like high noon!

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:10.270
My eyes can see the electromagnetic 
waves from the Devil Python.

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:14.770
Therefore, no matter how quickly 
it moves, I can track it.

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.180
I'll do it.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.480
I'll draw it away.

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:27.120
Meanwhile, you go search 
for Komatsu-kun, Toriko.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.420
Don't be silly!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.490
I didn't force Komatsu to come here with me.

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:38.030
He came with me of his own free will.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:38.900
Toriko!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:45.570
He knows this is a danger zone, 
and he's prepared for the worst.

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.940
But, Komatsu-kun...

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.940
Don't worry about him.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.340
Anyway, what do you think, Coco?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:56.580
Can you see the shadow of death 
around this Devil Python?

00:08:58.650 --> 00:08:59.620
No...

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:03.320
See? It's too much for you to handle alone.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.460
We'll crush it together!

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.670
Toriko and Coco, two of the Four 
Heavenly King Gourmet Hunters...

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.270
That's a pretty amazing combo!

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:20.910
I bet those two got their hands 
full with that Devil Python.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.010
While I have the chance,

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:25.280
I'll slip through to the cavern 
lagoon by a different route.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.950
I'll get my hands on the 
legendary Puffer Whale first!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:34.350
I'll use you as bait for the giant beasts!

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:36.120
You'll be my sacrifice!

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:43.930
This is bad...

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:47.400
This is a super... No, a super-duper 
large helping of trouble!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.600
Honestly, what a disgrace 
of a Gourmet Hunter...

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.270
That's just underhanded.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.740
Indeed!

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:56.570
If that entrance hadn't 
been blocked by rocks,

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.580
I, the great Zonge, would 
go show him who's boss!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:04.220
Right after you break through the swarm 
of millipedes near the entrance...

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.320
Although you ran away 
from them just before...

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:08.950
That's why you're not popular 
with the ladies, Zonge-sama.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.690
Did you say somethin'?

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.760
Just about how popular you are, Zonge-sama!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.090
Oh, is that so?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:23.600
Ooh, chocolate bars!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:24.540
Don't mind if I...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:25.600
Oww!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.510
I'm not just eating them for kicks!

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.240
I'm fueling my brain

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:34.210
so I can think real hard about 
what to do in this situation!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.280
Think...

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.780
Think, me!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:49.660
How many years has it been 
since we fought together?

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:52.030
Don't hold me back, Coco!

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.430
Shouldn't I be saying that to you?

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.340
It's not afraid of my intimidation 
or your poison, Coco.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.770
I haven't had a fight like this in a while!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.680
Knife!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.690
That's hard!

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.860
It tightened its elastic 
skin as much as it could,

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.020
increasing its hardness and durability.

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:56.930
Did it learn about Toriko's 
Knife just from that one attack?

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.170
Poison Cannon!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.620
It spit poison from its hair, too!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.660
It's definitely hard to 
see in this darkness...

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:27.490
Coco, can you stop the 
Devil Python's movement?

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:30.130
The Devil Python is a Reptilian Beast.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.000
A giant snake beast.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:37.240
The Devil Python should have "pit 
organs" like other nocturnal creatures.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.400
Pit organs?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:41.510
Yes. They are infrared 
thermal radiation sensors.

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:44.910
They basically function as secondary eyes.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:49.510
Above its nose, there are three places 
where the cells are activated.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.120
I bet those are the pit organs.

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:57.160
In other words, if we can seal those off...

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.920
Right. It won't be able to move.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.030
My poison, or the Devil Python's poison...

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.270
Let's have a match to see 
which one is deadlier!

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:12.940
As long as we can stop it from 
moving, I've got my secret move...

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.240
Secret move?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:36.130
My poison, or the Devil Python's poison...

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.430
Let's have a match to see 
which one is deadlier!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:44.340
As long as we can stop it from 
moving, I've got my secret move...

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.670
Secret move?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.840
Is this where you prove you 
haven't devoted yourself

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.810
to being a Gourmet Hunter just for show?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:24.610
It'll take a little time for 
me to build up the power.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:29.110
While you do that, I'll make 
sure to stop it from moving.

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:32.880
It's been a while since you 
used your poison powers...

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.750
Don't you think you might be a little rusty?

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.260
If you have the free time to worry about me,

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:41.130
then concentrate more on building up power!

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.430
Here I come, Devil Python!

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.280
Poison Rifle!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.130
All right!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.030
It's only a tiny amount, so 
it'll take a bit to take effect,

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:20.230
but that sticky poison should 
completely shut down its pit organs!

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.770
It can't see me now.

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:38.820
Poison Cannon!

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.520
What?

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.430
It had more than three pit organs?

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:51.960
It was hiding the others, 
closed, all this time?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.040
Poison Skin!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.080
Coco!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.090
Poison Skin...

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:26.900
I consume a great amount 
of poison inside my body,

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.270
and cover my body in a thin layer of poison.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:34.070
That way, I should be able to defend 
against the dissolving fluid.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.640
This is bad...

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.450
My poison is going to run out before 
it penetrates the Devil Python.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.720
Poison Cannon!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:07.970
Coco!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.340
Oh, no!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.110
It's pumping poison into 
him using its hair needles!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.050
Stay back, Toriko!

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:19.880
I thought you said you were 
concentrating on building up power...

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:20.590
Coco!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:23.790
You have antibodies for 
the Devil Python's poison?

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:25.890
No, I don't.

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.130
However...

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:39.240
Coco?!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.710
Extreme pain...

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:44.140
Hallucinogenic...

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.510
Hemorrhaging poison...

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:51.050
I've deciphered over 100 different 
proteins in the Devil Python's poison...

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:55.120
I've completed the manufacturing of 
antibodies using my special immunity powers!

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:06.760
If I don't have antibodies, 
then I just need to make them!

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.670
Because... I'm a poisonous man.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.490
How do you like the taste of my 
poison and the antibodies I created?

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:44.100
Okay, Toriko.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:48.510
Right!

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.240
Good work.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.920
I can finally see the 
shadow of death on it...

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:19.900
Five-fold...

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.340
Spiked Punch!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:27.650
One!

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:29.550
Two!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.480
Three!

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:33.220
Four!

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.050
Five!

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.220
Burst!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.600
Tired, Coco?

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:56.610
Yeah... I guess my body's gotten weak from 
just telling fortunes all the time...

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.580
I'm a little winded...

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.320
You're able to do five in a row?

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.960
I guess you need it, searching for 
such high-level ingredients...

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:19.000
Now, let's hurry and find Komatsu-kun!

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:21.900
How should we carry this?

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.170
We can worry about that later.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:28.710
We can't just leave it here! 
Someone else might eat it.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:32.580
My poison is in it, so it can't 
be eaten unless it's cooked first.

00:20:33.010 --> 00:20:35.010
The beasts shouldn't give it a second look.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.350
Besides, we have to hurry 
and find Komatsu-kun!

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:40.520
Just have to cook it, eh?

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.190
Hey, Toriko!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.090
I told you already, Komatsu's fine!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:52.300
I handed him a secret weapon to use 
if he ever got in a jam by himself.

00:20:57.340 --> 00:20:59.100
Y-You're kidding me!

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:00.640
Why is there one here, too?

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.080
No way!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:15.420
Toriko-san!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:34.140
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:40.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:47.620
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:52.590
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:57.700
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:01.070
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:01.070 --> 00:22:05.540
on a journey with no end!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:10.510
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:13.610
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:19.650
amid the waves of time.

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:24.420
Gourmet News!

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:28.660
Good morning! I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:32.500
Here is the ingredient that 
Toriko and Coco captured today!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:40.570
Devil Python (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 21

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:34.130
Devil Python!

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:36.300
It's normally a fairly plain meat,

00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:38.100
but while it was hiding in a cave,

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:40.870
it got marbled with fat 
and deepened in flavor...

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:43.840
Lightly sauté it, and 
the meat juices just...

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:48.180
And if you layer it with a fresh 
Neo Tomato to make a hamburger...

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:50.450
My! It's a giga-helping 
of first class flavor!

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:56.050
You'll be munching in a fevered daze, so 
watch out on dates... I should know...

00:23:02.460 --> 00:23:04.430
Now, the next story...

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:09.530
A legendary Gourmet Hunter arrives to rescue Chef Komatsu!

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:12.000
At the same time, Puffer Whales are found in the cavern!

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:14.220
Aw, I wish I was reporting from the scene!

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:17.040
The Knocking Master! Time to Taste the Puffer Whale!

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.370
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
